ngle III does not cover the region $D.$\n\n- Rectangles I and II cover the region $D$ completely.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265769 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152199 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "624215ff-efdc-5b12-8d61-9d66371672d9" :knowledge-point/title "Determining a Valid Region to Define a Double Integral Over a Non-Rectangular Domain"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b1fd765-1f38-5253-821b-f92c7d7a22ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263256} {:answer/id #uuid "3c7dcc02-00ba-51d0-a9b3-959e95073658" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263538} {:answer/id #uuid "85e25141-78e8-5a2d-a476-0226e7236451" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264155} {:answer/id #uuid "965c458a-34a0-5436-ac45-8e51732bdd28" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264285} {:answer/id #uuid "d53144bc-77d0-5f00-885f-be170ba5f88f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264854}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d53144bc-77d0-5f00-885f-be170ba5f88f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264854} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb0b24bd-c34c-59e1-9c5b-f4578cccaaa3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265573}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4a14dc47-818c-583a-957a-79ea6806459b" :ques